BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Get out the Vote in Black Mountain!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T060000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T080000
UID:13b4158563f91b793841d31c12378eda@mobilize.us
DESCRIPTION:Join us in Black Mountain for GOTV canvassing ahead of the Nov
 ember election! Volunteers will head out into neighborhoods to speak with 
 residents\, share election information\, and help community members learn 
 about upcoming voting opportunities. New to canvassing? No problem! We'll 
 provide training before each shift\, along with the information and materi
 als you'll need. Whether this is your first time knocking doors or you've 
 volunteered before\, all experience levels are welcome. What to bring: -
LOCATION:Sneed & Stearns Attorneys at Law\, 109 Church St\, Black Mountain
 \, NC\, 28711
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1061296/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
