BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:No Kings Day in Weaverville!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T120000
UID:faa6c3ad64a010f3643325849e5a214b@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/no%20kings%20oct%2017%20crop_20260927184024177144.png
DESCRIPTION:Join the Weaverville Dems at the Clock on Main Street! Stop by
  anytime with your signs encouraging people to VOTE for our DEMS. Let's re
 mind our friends and neighbors that EARLY voting has started and they can 
 vote TODAY! Power belongs to the people but only if we USE it! Who should 
 attend: Any Democratic or Dem-leaning unaffiliated voter!
LOCATION:Main St. under the Clock\, Weaverville\, NC\, 28787
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1047160/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Precinct 5.1 Monthly Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T153000
UID:4d80425bdde36b4bca33936a2bef15f5@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Precinct%205.1%20Monthly%20Meeting%20oct26_202610031502187498
 98.png
DESCRIPTION:We will be arranging last-minute roles for volunteers includin
 g canvassing\, and poll watching during early voting and on Election Day. 
 This is our last meeting before the general elections this fall. Let's not
  lose our momentum! Come and find out how you can help! Who should attend:
  Precinct 5.1 Democrats and left-leaning unaffiliated voters\, and people 
 from other precincts who would like to attend.
LOCATION:Asheville\, NC
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1054164/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
