BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Double Feature: The War Room & The Bunker @ HQ
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T203000
UID:d286561c23dbe6caeb52a5c662901fa0@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/WAR-ROOM-1_20261015001500055732.png
DESCRIPTION:Come hang with campaign workers\, volunteers\, and fellow Demo
 crats while watching The War Room\, the documentary about the insurgent Cl
 inton '92 campaign. After that\, we'll follow it up with The Bunker\, the 
 Documentary Now! spoof of that classic documentary. It's crunch time\, but
  that doesn't mean we can't have fun for one night!
LOCATION:Asheville\, NC
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1065542/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
